{"3006270": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Selsoviet", "steam_appid": 3006270, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006270/extras/91efa7aaa1639574998aabf9d3f31337.poster.avif?t=1788126750\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006270/extras/91efa7aaa1639574998aabf9d3f31337.webm?t=1788126750\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006270/extras/91efa7aaa1639574998aabf9d3f31337.mp4?t=1788126750\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A FUTURE THAT NEVER CAME</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Based on real events.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Liza was sent to Herota to work on one of the Soviet Far East’s largest mining projects. Herota was supposed to become a paradise for workers and their families. <strong>Instead, it became a trap</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now the village lives through endless shortages, and everyone who had a chance to leave is already gone. Her children are slowly dying, and the nearest hospital capable of helping them lies far beyond Herota.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006270/extras/28d3920c4e358586e897c09771129270.poster.avif?t=1788126750\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006270/extras/28d3920c4e358586e897c09771129270.webm?t=1788126750\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006270/extras/28d3920c4e358586e897c09771129270.mp4?t=1788126750\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DECIDE WHO GETS TO EAT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every delivery is too small.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decide who receives food from the limited supplies arriving in Herota.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take risks, deceive customers, and bend the rules before shortages spiral out of control.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Balance the needs of desperate villagers against the survival of your own family.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deal with conflicts, rumors, favors, and the growing tension inside the settlement.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch your choices slowly reshape life inside Herota.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006270/extras/07ac6143d6edb0813fac475f29a0add3.avif?t=1788126750\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006270/extras_big/07ac6143d6edb0813fac475f29a0add3.webp?t=1788126750 width=1560 height=878 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WHY DO WE LIVE?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many have given up on the settlement entirely and continue living only out of habit, waiting for nothing to change. But others are trying to build a different life in Herota — one shaped by old traditions, faith, family, and the hope that happiness can still exist even here.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For some, Herota is a terrible place they dream of escaping.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For others, it is still a City of the Sun where there is room for <strong>God, hope, and happiness</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006270/extras/85f102f0765af5ce87c90b77542fe353.poster.avif?t=1788126750\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006270/extras/85f102f0765af5ce87c90b77542fe353.webm?t=1788126750\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006270/extras/85f102f0765af5ce87c90b77542fe353.mp4?t=1788126750\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>NOTHING STAYS HIDDEN</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Herota, people notice everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rumors spread through the settlement faster than supplies. Every lie, favor, betrayal, or desperate decision slowly changes how people see you and your family. In a place where everyone knows everyone, nothing stays hidden forever.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape relationships through your actions and reputation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face the long-term consequences of fear, lies, and desperation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decide what kind of person survival turns you into.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006270/extras/336f7aac73ad5179c07942e8d06f6de8.poster.avif?t=1788126750\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006270/extras/336f7aac73ad5179c07942e8d06f6de8.webm?t=1788126750\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006270/extras/336f7aac73ad5179c07942e8d06f6de8.mp4?t=1788126750\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DISCOVER THE WORLD OF SELSOVIET</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive deeper into:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The history of Herota</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Its residents and their stories</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The game's lore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Exclusive artwork and development insights</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>on our official website.</strong></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>READY TO DECIDE WHO GETS TO EAT?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add <strong>Selsoviet</strong> to your <strong>wishlist</strong> and be there when the store opens.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006270/extras/91efa7aaa1639574998aabf9d3f31337.poster.avif?t=1788126750\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006270/extras/91efa7aaa1639574998aabf9d3f31337.webm?t=1788126750\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006270/extras/91efa7aaa1639574998aabf9d3f31337.mp4?t=1788126750\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A FUTURE THAT NEVER CAME</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Based on real events.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Liza was sent to Herota to work on one of the Soviet Far East’s largest mining projects. Herota was supposed to become a paradise for workers and their families. <strong>Instead, it became a trap</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now the village lives through endless shortages, and everyone who had a chance to leave is already gone. Her children are slowly dying, and the nearest hospital capable of helping them lies far beyond Herota.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><spa